# =============================================================================
# CoSF research repository — .gitignore
#
# Two categories matter more than the rest and are NOT negotiable:
#   (1) copyrighted source material
#   (2) human-subjects data
# Do not add exceptions to either. See CLAUDE.md §6.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# (1) Copyrighted material — never commit
# Keep your own notes in lit/notes/*.md and metadata in lit/references.bib instead.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pdf
*.epub
*.mobi
*.djvu
*.azw*
lit/papers/
lit/pdfs/
lit/books/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# (2) Human-subjects data — never commit
# No ethics approval exists yet. Once it does, data still lives outside git.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: written as `data/*` not `data/` — git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded, so `data/` + `!data/README.md` would silently drop the README.
data/*
!data/README.md
participants/
consent/
*consent*
*participant*
*transcript*
*interview*
*.sav
*.dta
recordings/
*.wav
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.mov

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Private working material — "good to have, should not commit"
# Anything under these paths is yours alone and stays local.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
private/
scratch/
_local/
drafts/
inbox/
*.private.md
*.local.md
TODO.private*

# Supervisor correspondence, applications, anything with third-party names in it
correspondence/
applications/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reference manager
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
zotero/
zotero-data/
*.bib.bak
*.sqlite

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Analysis environments
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
renv/library/
*.Rproj

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# JS / tooling
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.cache/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LaTeX build artefacts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.lof
*.lot
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.log

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
credentials*
secrets*

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor noise
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
